# =============================================================================
# Phase 0a: Soft potential SD minimization (cutoff=8.0A)
# Push all overlapping atoms to safe distances before real LJ.
# A=500000 provides strong repulsive force up to 8.0A cutoff.
# Using min_style sd (steepest descent) which is more robust for high-energy
# starting points than cg. Tight tolerances ensure full convergence.
# =============================================================================
pair_style      soft 8.0
pair_coeff      * * 500000.0
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
min_style       sd
minimize        1.0e-12 1.0e-8 2000 2000
